- **Two more classes were specified where their only consumer cannot reach them** — the F1 hasher's
  seam crossed twice more. F9's deep link and its evidence composition were both placed inside
  `src/ConnexPay/src/Dispute/`, but the deep link's only consumer is the `DisputeActionsPort`
